// Owner-supplied public identifiers (docs/release/owner-values.md). Included by Base.xcconfig, so every market and
// configuration sees the same values; a gitignored Local*.xcconfig may still override them for local checks.
// No secret belongs here: the WeChat AppSecret is `app.wechat.app.appsecret` on the backend.

// P0-5: WeChat Open Platform mobile-app AppID (starts with "wx", NOT the mini-program AppID). The placeholder is a valid
// URL scheme that no WeChat app answers, and WeChatAppLaunch rejects it (no "wx" prefix), so the WeChat button stays
// hidden until the real AppID is set. It also fills the CFBundleURLTypes "weixin" scheme in Config/Info.plist.
QUESTIFY_WECHAT_APP_ID = chein-wechat-unset
// The Universal Link registered for the app on the WeChat Open Platform (owner plan 9-14). Must end in "/".
// `$()` keeps the URL from being read as an xcconfig comment.
QUESTIFY_WECHAT_UNIVERSAL_LINK = https:/$()/www.chengyinhub.com/app/
// P1-1: the one verified https origin for Universal Links (AppUniversalLinkRouter). Host name only.
QUESTIFY_APP_LINK_DOMAIN = www.chengyinhub.com
// fix-1128b #22: extra https origins (comma separated) that uploadOSS results and play kit artwork are served from,
// e.g. the OSS bucket or CDN host. The API origin is always included. Empty keeps only the API origin. Write each URL
// as https:/$()/host so the xcconfig does not read it as a comment. Read as Info.plist `CYStampImageOrigins`.
QUESTIFY_IMAGE_ORIGINS =
